    "answer": "The sweep makes long calls. lore-api answers the backfill POST only once a repo is completely done. Node's fetch gives up after about 300 s (5 minutes) if it hasn't received response headers, so it would abort long backfills. The sweep therefore uses node:http/https, which lets it set a 30-minute timeout.",
